{"v":4,"catch":"解決所有級別","desc":"Dungeon Bricker是一款緊張刺激的迷宮遊戲。這是一個獨特而有趣的標題，您的重點是嘗試將玩家從牆壁移動到全部或角落到角落，以創建一條積木路徑並完成關卡。一旦該級別充滿磚塊，您就可以到達下一個級別。有超過 150 個關卡需要通過，您將在享受每一刻的同時享受很多樂趣，同時也測試您的技能。你有能力完成所有級別嗎？\n特徵：\n- 150 多個關卡等你來玩\n- 測試你的技能，玩得開心\n- 有趣的遊戲機制\n- 酷像素藝術","publisher":"Piotr Skalski","release":"2021-07-22","genres":["益智","街機","學習","訓練"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9211ba294cf8a0281b6a42352cde87bffbf3063b5d76ad8bda6b30fdab6502ca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/846c9393147f6c26835d0b135b746847fd229024a49b298664730c4780eb032e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00058669b7489fdc6bea3ba09789c5c64d67540423deba4f989b02bc43ceb955.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ebce3da575c3cafc1ff5d747968dd74dba2bca3aed3375023423e3281a25d336.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/009fa2b5c57006d060fd5b72fe59ffa677dce82e65668725b38ed7fd66ef8cbf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59e3a4881f69ea74b2b15b87fe6fff3950d44ce3be83834cf3b45089894c4979.jpg"],"titleId":"010058e015b10000","dlc":[]}